224
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:25,755
pickle. As for the ends of the flukes, have them sousted, cook, there, now you

225
00:19:25,756 --> 00:19:32,479
may go. But Fleece had hardly got three paces off when he was recalled. Cook,

226
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:37,274
give me cutlets for supper tomorrow night in the midwatch. Do you hear? Away

227
00:19:37,275 --> 00:19:45,359
you sail, then. Hello. Stop. Make a bow before you go. Avast heaving again.

